  "details": "I've never had issues running vrchat before, but as of the latest update, it seems to crash and/or brick my pc completely when:\n1) messing with the avatar hider settings\n2) loading avatars\n3) after about 30 minutes to 1 hour of playing\nI have looked into the vrchat output logs and not found anything, I would gladly provide them if needed, I still have them saved.\nI have had a similar issue on the open beta that added avatar hider as well. I have made sure my game is completely clean, having wiped the whole folder and reinstalled, twice to make sure.\n\nEDIT: I am running full AMD hardware, a Ryzen 3 2600x and a RX580 8gb version and 32gb of ram. I typically get around 20-30 fps in very heavy instances with 40+ people, so this is a very new issue to me.",
